$DIR/main.p:13:1: interrupt handler h cannot be //pu:inline
    A //pu:interrupt function is entered by the processor, not called by
    Plutonium code. So it must be a plain function with a body: not a method,
    not generic, and not marked //pu:inline, since the processor needs one fixed
    address to jump to.
    (see "Interrupts" in the Plutonium spec, section 20.10)
    (run "pluto explain E2570" for a longer explanation)
